  "components": [
    {
      "name": "Primary Button",
      "kind": "button",
      "refersTo": "button-primary",
      "description": "Theme-filled save or confirm action with a visible focus outline.",
      "html": "<button class=\"ds-button-primary\" type=\"button\">저장</button>",
      "css": ".ds-button-primary { min-width: 72px; min-height: 36px; padding: 0 12px; border: 1px solid transparent; border-radius: 8px; background: var(--color-accent); color: var(--color-surface); cursor: pointer; font: inherit; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 500; transition: background-color 140ms var(--ease-standard, cubic-bezier(.2,.8,.2,1)); } .ds-button-primary:hover { background: var(--color-accent-hover); } .ds-button-primary:focus-visible { outline: 2px solid var(--color-accent); outline-offset: 2px; } .ds-button-primary:disabled { opacity: .55; cursor: not-allowed; }"
    },
    {
      "name": "Secondary Button",
      "kind": "button",
      "refersTo": "button-secondary",
      "description": "Quiet cancel or close action beside a primary action.",
      "html": "<button class=\"ds-button-secondary\" type=\"button\">취소</button>",
      "css": ".ds-button-secondary { min-width: 72px; min-height: 36px; padding: 0 12px; border: 1px solid var(--color-border); border-radius: 8px; background: var(--color-surface); color: var(--color-secondary); cursor: pointer; font: inherit; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 500; } .ds-button-secondary:hover { border-color: var(--color-control-outline); background: var(--color-hover); } .ds-button-secondary:focus-visible { outline: 2px solid var(--color-accent); outline-offset: 2px; }"
    },
    {
      "name": "Planner Field",
      "kind": "input",
      "refersTo": "input",
      "description": "Compact field for task, date, and settings forms.",
      "html": "<label class=\"ds-field\"><span>메모</span><input type=\"text\" placeholder=\"내용 입력\"></label>",
      "css": ".ds-field { display: grid; gap: 5px; color: var(--color-secondary); font: inherit; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 500; } .ds-field input { box-sizing: border-box; width: 100%; min-height: 42px; padding: 8px 12px; border: 1px solid var(--color-border); border-radius: 10px; background: var(--color-surface); color: var(--color-primary); font: inherit; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 450; } .ds-field input:hover { border-color: var(--color-control-outline); } .ds-field input:focus-visible { outline: 2px solid var(--color-accent); }"
    },
    {
      "name": "Progress Card",
      "kind": "card",
      "refersTo": "card",
      "description": "Compact deadline card with endpoints and a progress track.",
      "html": "<article class=\"ds-card\"><div class=\"ds-card-heading\"><strong>학회 논문 제출</strong><span>미완료 2/3</span></div><div class=\"ds-card-dates\"><span>10.04 09:00</span><span>10.15 09:00</span></div><div class=\"ds-card-track\"><span></span></div></article>",
      "css": ".ds-card { position: relative; min-width: 0; height: 72px; padding: 8px 13px; border: 1px solid var(--color-border); border-radius: 10px; background: var(--color-surface); color: var(--color-primary); } .ds-card-heading, .ds-card-dates { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; gap: 8px; } .ds-card-heading { font-size: 13px; line-height: 20px; } .ds-card-heading span, .ds-card-dates { color: var(--color-secondary); font-size: 11px; } .ds-card-dates { margin-top: 2px; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; } .ds-card-track { position: absolute; right: 13px; bottom: 16px; left: 13px; height: 6px; overflow: hidden; border-radius: 999px; background: var(--color-progress-track); } .ds-card-track span { display: block; width: 58%; height: 100%; border-radius: inherit; background: var(--color-accent); }"
    },
    {
      "name": "Weekday Chip",
      "kind": "chip",
      "refersTo": "chip",
      "description": "Circular weekday choice with a quiet selected state.",
      "html": "<button class=\"ds-chip\" type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"true\">금</button>",
      "css": ".ds-chip { display: inline-grid; width: 42px; height: 42px; place-items: center; padding: 0 12px; border: 1px solid var(--color-border); border-radius: 999px; background: var(--color-surface); color: var(--color-secondary); cursor: pointer; font: inherit; font-size: 12px; } .ds-chip:hover { background: var(--color-hover); } .ds-chip[aria-pressed='true'] { border-color: var(--color-accent); background: var(--color-accent-soft); color: var(--color-accent); } .ds-chip:focus-visible { outline: 2px solid var(--color-accent); outline-offset: 2px; }"
    },
    {
      "name": "Floating Bottom Navigation",
      "kind": "nav",
      "refersTo": "navigation",
      "description": "Icon-first route navigation with a soft active indicator.",
      "html": "<nav class=\"ds-nav\" aria-label=\"주요 메뉴\"><a class=\"ds-nav-link is-active\" href=\"#home\" aria-label=\"홈\" aria-current=\"page\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m3 10 9-7 9 7v10a1 1 0 0 1-1 1h-5v-7H9v7H4a1 1 0 0 1-1-1z\"/></svg></a><a class=\"ds-nav-link\" href=\"#calendar\" aria-label=\"캘린더\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"3\" y=\"5\" width=\"18\" height=\"16\" rx=\"2\"/><path d=\"M8 3v4M16 3v4M3 10h18M8 14h2M14 14h2M8 17h2\"/></svg></a><a class=\"ds-nav-link\" href=\"#settings\" aria-label=\"사용자 설정\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"8\" r=\"4\"/><path d=\"M4 21c.6-4 3.4-6 8-6s7.4 2 8 6\"/></svg></a></nav>",
      "css": ".ds-nav { position: relative; display: flex; width: max-content; min-width: 208px; height: 56px; align-items: center; justify-content: center; gap: 24px; padding: 4px 14px; border: 1px solid var(--color-border); border-radius: 999px; background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-surface) 94%, transparent); box-shadow: 0 8px 28px rgba(0,0,0,.14); backdrop-filter: blur(14px); } .ds-nav-link { display: grid; width: 48px; height: 48px; place-items: center; border-radius: 999px; color: var(--color-secondary); } .ds-nav-link svg { width: 24px; height: 24px; fill: none; stroke: currentColor; stroke-width: 1.8; stroke-linecap: round; stroke-linejoin: round; } .ds-nav-link:hover { background: var(--color-hover); } .ds-nav-link.is-active { background: var(--color-accent-soft); color: var(--color-accent); } .ds-nav-link:focus-visible { outline: 2px solid var(--color-accent); outline-offset: 2px; } @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) { .ds-nav-link { transition: none; } }"
    },
    {
      "name": "Timed Schedule Block",
      "kind": "custom",
      "refersTo": "event-block",
      "description": "Time-grid event with a theme-colored leading edge and soft fill.",
      "html": "<button class=\"ds-event\" type=\"button\"><strong>연구실 세미나</strong><span>13:00–14:30</span></button>",
      "css": ".ds-event { display: flex; min-width: 0; flex-direction: column; gap: 5px; overflow: hidden; padding: 8px 8px 8px 10px; border: 0; border-left: 1px solid var(--color-accent); border-radius: 8px; background: var(--color-accent-soft); color: var(--color-primary); cursor: pointer; text-align: left; font: inherit; } .ds-event strong { overflow: hidden; font-size: 10px; font-weight: 500; line-height: 17px; text-overflow: ellipsis; white-space: nowrap; } .ds-event span { color: var(--color-secondary); font-size: 9px; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; white-space: nowrap; } .ds-event:hover { background: var(--color-accent-soft); } .ds-event:focus-visible { outline: 2px solid var(--color-accent); outline-offset: 1px; }"
    }
  ],
  "narrative": {
    "northStar": "The Research Notebook",
    "overview": "Todo is a quiet Korean-first planner for university and graduate students. Its visual system supports quick scanning across academic deadlines, timed events, and daily tasks. The interface keeps a white canvas and black text, then uses the selected color theme to mark focus, progress, and schedule categories.\n\nThe layout favors compact information with clear roles: the month view supports date selection, the week view lays out seven days against a vertical time scale, and progress cards keep longer deadlines visible. The common controls stay restrained so titles, dates, and remaining time carry the emphasis.",
    "keyCharacteristics": [
      "Quiet, monochrome foundation.",
      "One selectable accent theme at a time.",
      "Compact, date-led information with clear calendar and task roles."
    ],
    "rules": [
      {
        "name": "The One Accent Rule",
        "body": "Keep focus, selection, progress, and active navigation tied to the selected theme. Do not mix unrelated accent palettes within one view.",
        "section": "colors"
      },
      {
        "name": "The Flat Card Rule",
        "body": "Keep ordinary cards defined by their border and surface. Reserve visible shadow for floating or modal layers.",
        "section": "elevation"
      }
    ],
    "dos": [
      "Do use the active theme consistently for focus, selection, progress, and event accents.",
      "Do preserve the seven-column calendar and make the time labels easy to scan.",
      "Do distinguish ordinary tasks, timed events, and deadline progress cards by their established layout roles.",
      "Do keep shadows shallow and limited to floating or modal surfaces."
    ],
    "donts": [
      "Don't make calendar grid lines or the outer grid border visually heavy; major hour lines should remain only slightly stronger than minor lines.",
      "Don't add decorative shadows to ordinary cards or fields.",
      "Don't mix multiple accent themes in the same view.",
      "Don't round every container into a pill; reserve circular and pill shapes for selectors and navigation."
    ]
  }
}
